# Arriving in Verdance after escaping your starting dungeon (Milestone 20a;
# {next} / {next_where} fill in the next dungeon on this game's route, 20b).
# Frank walks the player in, then heads off to set up his stall. Plays once.

spawn guide frank at ~1,0 facing left
face player right
say Frank: Verdance. Quiet as a held breath - but the roofs are still standing, and that's something.
say Frank: I'll set up my stall down by the pond. Come see me for supplies. And if anyone falls, bring them to me - I know a trick or two.
say Frank: The inn will put you up for the night. After that, {next}, {next_where}. One of the others is held there.
say Frank: Mind, a place like that will be locked up tight by now. Ask around - folk here and in Edenmere may know a way in.
move guide to 15,13
despawn guide
set verdance_frank
